description	"Chewbacca aka 'Chewie'

A legendary Wookiee with overwhelming strength and firepower. 

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Wookiee Slugthrower (Shotgun 2)
-- Staggers on hit
-- Mag reload
- Chewbacca's Bowcaster (3)
-- 10% more charged FP damage
- 2 Frag Grenades
- 1 Pulse Grenade

^8Attributes:
- 15% faster skill cooldown
- 10% faster hacking
- Strength (2)
- Fury (1)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Rage ^3[Melee CS1]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[Melee CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

Chewbacca is a legendary Wookiee from Kashyyyk and co-pilot of Han Solo's ship, the Millennium Falcon."